    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome in the underwater world of a mermaid, with aquatics creatures &amp; the queen, welcome in The World of a Mermaid! That's a casual game, ideal for kids. <br><br>The main character of this game is a mermaid and you as the main character will have different uncommon tasks to do. Be prepared for the most unusual experience underwater where you will have 5 different activities as a mermaid, like taking care of the fish or even cleaning the ocean. <br><br>Game features : <br>- Creating a mermaid look using the most precious stones<br>- Giving first aid to fish in need<br>- Cleaning the water and releasing the fish from the fishermen's net<br>- Find hidden treasures",
